{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:23:301","content":{"id":301,"title":"心法篇，以我为主，持续不断","content":[{"type":"project-card-list","items":[{"id":302,"title":"以我为主","summary":"一会儿积累这方面的知识，一会儿积累那方面的知识，墙头草，不知道自己的方向。一个原则：以我为主，增援未来的自己，未来的自己会怎么用，未来想成为什么样的人，以终为始","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:302","type":"doc","id":302}},{"id":303,"title":"持续不断","summary":"持续记录的重要性，知识需要时间的累积才能看到效果，不可能一口气吃成一个大胖子。换了很多的笔记软件，尝试了很多的笔记方法，都没有办法坚持不断的进行记录，原因在于没","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:303","type":"doc","id":303}}],"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3172ab1d-83c0-4ad9-a81d-3fd35f686bfb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如何积累知识，两个原则："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"4b449836-571a-41b9-841e-851e59a144df","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1db6e8a8-51db-4f0d-b5d7-9c3665b15e01","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"62716cc3-225b-47a6-8379-b7e7f19dfbf1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以我为主"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2e1bc4ee-fe98-41a6-bbf5-1dfcc6376ab6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"759b9d00-8884-48b1-a01b-1406ee632458","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"持续不断"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0d58080e-2253-4bb9-8a01-dc7dfdeb0100","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"笔记的方法","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:275","type":"doc"